  },
  "section": "3.106",
  "rulesText": "- Gain the following traits from the Core Fighter Traits table: Hit Point Die, proficiency with Martial weapons, and training with Light and Medium armor and Shields.  \n- Gain the Fighter's level 1 features, which are listed in the Fighter Features table."
}
